IT:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Ehi, sei tu, gamberetto?{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}} {{TAG:0003:0006:}}Ricordati
sempre: un vero uomo si riconosce
da quello che beve!{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}

EN:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Aye, do that be {{TAG:0005:0000:}}?{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Ye be here for some bean brew?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}Don't ye just stand there, though!{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}
Why don't ye try a cup?

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Şeker{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}} yok{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}. Erkek dediğin dünyaya
şekersiz gelir! Sonra hayat{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0006:}}
zaten yeterince tatlandırır{{TAG:0003:0023:}}, yar.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}È primavera, {{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}{{TAG:0005:0000:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}
La stagione degli amori!{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}} {{TAG:0003:0023:}}Perché
non ti trovi una bella sirenetta?

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Bahar zamanı, {{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}{{TAG:0005:0000:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}} Yeni aşklar
mevsimi. Gözünü açık tut;{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}} belki{{TAG:0003:0023:}}
kalbini demirleyecek birini bulursun.

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}J'aime danser sous la pluie !{{TAG:0000:0004:}}Danser, et boire du café. Car la
pluie intensifie l'arôme du café.{{TAG:0003:0023:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}} {{TAG:0003:0023:}}Pas
vrai, {{TAG:0000:0003:0400}}Robusto {{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}?{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Regentage auf Deck sind 'ne
Freude für jeden Kapitän, jaharrr!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Die tobende See,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} die salzige Gischt,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
die Sturzflut von oben...{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Danach ist
man mit allen Wassern gewaschen!{{TAG:0003:0000:}}
Jaharrr,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} und 'n ordentlicher Kaffee
ist die beste Stärkung dafür!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}
{{TAG:0003:0023:}}Hab ich recht,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0000:0003:0400}}Kofi{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}?{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Chi lavora con la barca come me
non può prendersi giorni di ferie,{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}
neanche quando nevica!{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Ma quando vedo i miei clienti tutti
sorridenti{{TAG:0007:0000:04000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:04000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:04000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:04000000}} allora so che tutto
il mio lavoro ha un perché!{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
E tutta la mia stanchezza scompare!
{{TAG:0003:001C:}}Soprattutto quando vedo
sorridere... le mie clienti!

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Weißte, was an Echsen so toll ist?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Das sind kleine Biester, genau
wie ich!
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Jarrr,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} 'n guter Kapitän ist im Innern
'n kleiner, biestiger Tyrann, der
gegen die tobende See ankämpft!
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Nur auf Landgang bekommt der
Tyrann Urlaub.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0002:}}Sonst würden meine Mädels daheim
ihn mir ganz schnell austreiben,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
harr, harr!{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Kertenkeleleri severim. Pulları
falan{{TAG:0003:0009:}}... küçük canavarlar{{TAG:0003:0006:}}
gibiler{{TAG:0003:0001:}}. Hanım, kızım{{TAG:0003:0017:}},{{TAG:0003:0009:}} annem;
hepsi bu{{TAG:0003:0013:}} merakımı{{TAG:0003:0002:}} bilir.

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Fische sind immer total nass und
schuppig,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} fast wie 'ne glitschige
Echse, die kein Feuer spucken kann.
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Harrr?!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:0006:}}Du hast noch nie 'ne
feuerspuckende Echse gesehen?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Du musst mal die Welt erkunden!
Aber zieh dich feuerfest an, jarrr?{{TAG:0003:0002:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Harrr, harrr, harrr!{{TAG:0003:0025:}}

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Che mi prenda un tonno... In tutti
questi anni di vita di mare non ho
mai visto una sirena!
{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Tutti mi dicono che è colpa mia,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
perché non sono un vero lupo
di mare... {{TAG:0003:0006:}}Fandonie!{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
Queste sirene hanno proprio
la puzza sotto il naso!{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
Che restino nei loro fondali!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:000B:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}Keşke benim de o kadar saçım
olsaydı. Deniz yıllar içinde
benden epey vergi aldı,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} yar{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}

IT:
Sai, gamberetto, prima di iniziare
il mio lavoro attuale ho fatto
tante altre cose.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:000B:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}Sono stato autista d'autobus,{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}
tassista{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}} e anche rematore.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0013:}}Quello sì che era un lavoraccio!{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Remavo avanti e indietro cento
volte al giorno,{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}} anche con la pioggia!
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Beh, più o meno come faccio ora.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Ma per i miei clienti questo e altro!{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0023:}}Soprattutto per le mie clienti...{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Ehm, per la mia famiglia, ovvio!

TRANSLATION:
Hanım kızımızı düzgün
yetiştirmeye kararlı. Denizci{{TAG:0003:0009:}}
ağzımdan nefret ediyor.
'Poseidon'un kıvırcık bacak
kılları{{TAG:0003:0006:}} adına!' deyince kızıyor;
'Aman, ne{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} can{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0024:}} sıkıcı'{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}} dememi
istiyor. O laflarla{{TAG:0003:000B:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}} düğüne mi
gidilir, yar{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}?{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}

DE:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}Hier gibt's nur kochend heißen
Kaffee, sonst nichts.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Und Gurken
gibt's schon gleich zweimal nicht.{{TAG:000C:0009:}}
